    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "How might we make Ferpa Lima’s expertise feel as credible and approachable online as it is in practice?"
            }
          ],
          "align": "center"
        },
        {
          "kind": "subheading",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "PROBLEM FRAMING"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "The live site had strong credentials (PhD, publications, CREF), but dense copy and uneven hierarchy buried them. Prospective clients struggled to understand the offer, how pricing worked, and why individualized, science-prescribed routines were different from generic coaching. Messy SEO also hurt Google discovery for the site overall and made it harder for search traffic to convert."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Audience",
              "marks": [
                "bold",
                "italic",
                "display"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Primary clients are women and gay men roughly 20-45, often from the LGBT community, looking for health and weight-loss support in a judgment-free space that softens aversion to fitness. The redesign also needed clearer signals for growth segments: pregnancy, older adults, diabetes, TAF prep, and chronic pain."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Constraints",
              "marks": [
                "bold",
                "italic",
                "display"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Keep "
            },
            {
              "text": "Wix"
            },
            {
              "text": " for payment processing and finance accountability, and design within its builder limits for plans, checkout, forms, and SEO settings. Preserve brand colors and Portuguese product copy, protect academic credibility, avoid hype-led claims, and improve conversion without inventing new product lines."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
