    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Before",
              "marks": [
                "bold",
                "italic",
                "display"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "The previous homepage leaned on long text blocks and flat headers. Credentials were easy to miss, and pricing sat buried inside a longer scroll."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "After",
              "marks": [
                "bold",
                "italic",
                "display"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "The redesigned homepage leads with individualized, science-based training, clearer section rhythm, plan teasers, scannable credentials, inclusive audience signals, and an obvious path to hire."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "kind": "subheading",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "RESEARCH"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Audit overview",
              "marks": [
                "bold",
                "italic",
                "display"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "I mapped ferpalima.com.br into a hub-and-spoke sitemap to clarify hierarchy before redesigning, then completed the current-state set with captures of homepage, about, consultancy, blog, policies, and exercises."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Heuristic findings",
              "marks": [
                "bold",
                "italic",
                "display"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "• Primary CTAs and pricing competed with long informational sections"
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "• Strong academic credentials were visually underweighted against marketing sites"
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "• Navigation worked page to page, but section rhythm made skimming hard"
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "• Live-site SEO needed cleanup: titles, meta, headings, and indexing were misaligned with how Google should discover the consultancy"
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Evidence from usage",
              "marks": [
                "bold",
                "italic",
                "display"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Stakeholder notes locked the brief: keep payment workflows intact, lead with evidence-based exercise science without fake promises, treat individualized routines as the differentiator, and speak clearly to the core audience while surfacing growth segments. Those priorities shaped the four-page scope."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
