    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "kind": "subheading",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "DESIGN PRINCIPLES"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "The principles balance credibility and conversion without diluting the science-led brand or inventing outcome promises."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "• Lead with the differentiator: individualized, science-prescribed routines before deep biography"
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "• Make trust scannable: testimonials, credentials, and publications as distinct beats, with no fake promises"
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "• Package decisions: pricing cards and CTAs as first-class UI that can ship with existing checkout and contact patterns"
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "• Signal audience clearly: inclusive tone for LGBT clients and people returning to fitness, plus scannable special-group coverage"
            }
          ],
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Tradeoff: denser academic content moved to About so homepage and pricing could convert faster, while specialists still reach bio and publications without friction."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "kind": "subheading",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "SOLUTION"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "The redesign focuses on the four highest-priority visitor paths: Homepage for story and offer, Pricing for plan decisions, About for credibility and inclusive identity, and Contact for hiring. Alongside the UI, I planned SEO for the Wix build inside Figma: page intent, heading hierarchy, and title/meta guidance so those settings could be applied in the builder without guessing from the old site. Screenshots below use English for an international portfolio audience; the live Brazilian product remains in Portuguese."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
